  "reference": "Okuruga 33",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Musa ati, “Oimukye oruge hanu, iwe n'abantu abo waihire omu nsi ya Misiri, ogye omu nsi eyo nanahiliire Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, ningamba nti, ‘Ndigiha abana bawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndatweka omumalaika akwebembere, mara ndabinga Abakanaani, Abaamori, Abahiti, Abaperizi, Abahivi n'Abayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otembe ogye omu nsi elikusheshekana amata n'obwoki. Kyonkai tindikugenda na inywe, ntakwija nkabamalira mu muhanda, ahakuba muli bantu abagumangaine emitima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo abantu bahuliire amakuru gabi aga bachura, kandi taliho n'omoi yajwete milengyoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'enshonga Omukama akaba agambire Musa kugambira Abaisiraeli ati, “Inywe muli bantu abagumangaine emitima. Kanakuzizaho kugenda na inywe nakubamaraho. Kityo mujure emilengyo yanyu nyije manye ekyo ndabakora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bajura emilengyo yabo, kubandiza aha Ibanga lya Horebu n'okugendelera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yakwataga eihema alitera enjai y'orusisira, harai kuruga aha rusisira orwo. Akalyeta Ihema ly'Omuterano. Buli muntu ayahigaga Omukama yashohoraga agya aha Ihema ly'Omuterano elyo elyabaire lili enjai y'orusisira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Musa yaturukaga kugya aha Ihema, abantu bona bemelera, buli omoi ayemelera aha rwigi rw'eihemalye, ahondeza Musa amaisho alemwa ataha omw'ihema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Musa yatahaga omw'ihema enyomyo y'ekichwi esongoka, eyemelera aha rwigi rw'eihema elyo, aho Omukama afumora nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo abantu boa babonaga enyomyo y'ekichwi eyemeleire aha rwigi rw'eihema, bayemeleraga bafukama, buli omoi ayemire aha rwigi rw'eihemalye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo Omukama yafumoraga na Musa nibabonangana, nk'okwo omuntu afumora na munywanyiwe. Orwo Musa yagarukire omu rusisira, omwiruwe Yoshua, omusigazi mutabani wa Nuni, tiyarugaga mw'ihema elyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agambira Omukama ati, “Lea nongambira oti, ‘Otware abantu aba,’ kyonkai tokamanyisize ow'orantuma nawe. Mara ogambire oti, ‘Ninkumanya eibara kandi kwakwo nonshemelera.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu nu ninkutagiliza, kandaba ninkushemelerakwo, ongambire eby'olikwenda, mbone kukukolera n'okukushemeleza. Ekindi omanye okwo eihanga eli lili ihanga lyawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agamba ati, “Ndagenda naiwe, kandi ndakuha okusinga endashana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa amugambira ati, “K'oraba otagende nanye, hanu aha otatwihyaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yakumanyira nkahai okwo inye n'abantu bawe tulikukushemelera? K'olikugenda naichwe ekyo nikyo kiratwahura omu mahanga agandi omu nsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Musa ati, “Eki kyonene kyonene ekyo wagamba ndakikora, aha rw'okuba nonshemelera, kandi n'okukumanya eibara ninkumanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa agamba ati, “Ninkutagiliza banyoleke ekitinwa kyawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agamba ati, “Inye ndakukolera ebirungi byona omu maisho gawe, mara ndaranga eibara lyange ‘Mukama’ omu maisho gawe. Kandi owo ndagilira obufura ndamugilira obufura; n'owo ndaganyira ndamuganyira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ashuba agamba ati, “Toina kumbona buso; aha rw'enshonga omuntu tiyakumbona akarora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe leba aha rubaju rwange haliho omwanya mbali orayemelera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo ekitinwa kyange kiraba nikihinguraho ndakuta omu rutanda rw'orwazi orwo, kandi ndakubunza omukono gwange kuhika orwo ndaba nahingwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ndakwihyaho omukono ombone omugongo; kyonkai obuso bwange tibuboneke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
